    "disclosures": [
      {
        "id": "d1",
        "from": 1,
        "to": 1,
        "text": "第2章标题为《反派的日常就是找茬》。",
        "channel": "author",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d2",
        "from": 2,
        "to": 2,
        "text": "作者严正声明：本书出场角色均已满18岁，不存在任何未成年人。",
        "channel": "author",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d3",
        "from": 6,
        "to": 6,
        "text": "苏天晴吐掉牙膏泡沫，放下猫猫水杯与牙刷，双手撑住洗手池，抬头看向镜子里的金毛狐狐。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_fox"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d4",
        "from": 7,
        "to": 7,
        "text": "镜中的狐狐五官精致可爱，毛发柔顺肌肤光滑，能从宽松睡衣领口看到浅浅河谷，眼眸不安而惊讶，带着狐人天生的魅意。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_fox",
          "r_body"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d5",
        "from": 8,
        "to": 8,
        "text": "苏天晴认为，抛开听起来很离谱的反派魔法少女身份不谈，这副身体的容貌绝妙。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_villain_mg",
          "r_body"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d6",
        "from": 9,
        "to": 9,
        "text": "苏天晴觉得这具身体的每个细节都满足自己曾经的幻想，让人想细细品尝。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_body",
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d7",
        "from": 10,
        "to": 10,
        "text": "苏天晴说了一声“舔”。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d8",
        "from": 12,
        "to": 12,
        "text": "苏天晴觉得美妙，认为“爷”太可爱了。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d9",
        "from": 13,
        "to": 13,
        "text": "苏天晴认为无论面庞还是身材都和自己曾经想象的完美匹配。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_body",
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d10",
        "from": 14,
        "to": 14,
        "text": "苏天晴认为萝莉本身就是最美妙的奖励，不需要别的奖励。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_fox"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d11",
        "from": 15,
        "to": 15,
        "text": "苏天晴心里念着“可爱的小狐狸”。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_fox"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d12",
        "from": 17,
        "to": 17,
        "text": "苏天晴与镜中自己对视后，察觉自己举动像变态，脸红并收敛，开始审视身体中残留的记忆。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_body"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d13",
        "from": 18,
        "to": 18,
        "text": "据残留记忆，这副身体的原主人也叫苏天晴；这个世界与苏天晴曾经的世界相差无几，但人类与兽人共存。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_orig_su",
          "r_body",
          "r_human",
          "r_beastfolk"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d14",
        "from": 19,
        "to": 19,
        "text": "这里所说的兽人指猫娘、狐娘，不是地里长出来的大菌子绿皮。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_beastfolk"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d15",
        "from": 20,
        "to": 20,
        "text": "据残留记忆，兽人与人类名义上共存，但兽人数量远不及人类；原主苏天晴从小孤独长大，模样可爱但社恐孤僻，受兽人互助协会资助考上蓉城最好的医学院，临近开学时染上兽人流感，熬夜中突发暴发性心肌炎。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_beastfolk",
          "r_human",
          "r_orig_su",
          "r_association",
          "r_rongcheng",
          "r_medical"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d16",
        "from": 21,
        "to": 21,
        "text": "苏天晴发现原主的死法和自己一模一样。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_orig_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d17",
        "from": 23,
        "to": 23,
        "text": "苏天晴想到这感觉胸口幻痛，伸手去揉。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d18",
        "from": 25,
        "to": 25,
        "text": "简单洗漱后，苏天晴穿着不合脚的大拖鞋走到客厅，躺上沙发，从茶几上拿起那本曾跟自己说话的古书。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_book"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d19",
        "from": 26,
        "to": 26,
        "text": "苏天晴对着古书问：“喂？小破书你在吗？”",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_book"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d20",
        "from": 28,
        "to": 28,
        "text": "古书没有像刚才那样开口说话，仿佛床头那件事没发生过。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_book"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d21",
        "from": 29,
        "to": 29,
        "text": "苏天晴揣测，所谓的反派魔法少女可能根本不存在。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_villain_mg"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d22",
        "from": 30,
        "to": 30,
        "text": "苏天晴抱着侥幸举起古书，翻开扉页。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_su",
          "r_book"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d23",
        "from": 33,
        "to": 33,
        "text": "一枚金色十字星从书里掉出，砸在毫无防备的苏天晴脸上。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_star",
          "r_book",
          "r_su"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d24",
        "from": 35,
        "to": 35,
        "text": "狐狐喊疼，惊呼鼻血冒出来了。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_fox",
        "about": [
          "r_fox"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d25",
        "from": 36,
        "to": 36,
        "text": "金毛狐狐怪叫着去抓纸巾，没有注意到金色十字星沾上鼻血，血在微光中融入十字星消失。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_fox",
          "r_star"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d26",
        "from": 37,
        "to": 37,
        "text": "一道陌生的声音在狐狐脑子里响起。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_voice",
          "r_fox"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d27",
        "from": 38,
        "to": 38,
        "text": "系统提示：守护之星激活。",
        "channel": "in-world-system",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_star"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d28",
        "from": 39,
        "to": 39,
        "text": "系统提示：秘典序章已完成，开启每日任务。",
        "channel": "in-world-system",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_book",
          "r_task"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d29",
        "from": 40,
        "to": 40,
        "text": "苏天晴对“每日任务”和“守护之星”感到惊讶，觉得系统来真的。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_su",
        "about": [
          "r_task",
          "r_star"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d30",
        "from": 41,
        "to": 41,
        "text": "狐狐正在塞纸巾、拍冷水，愣了一下，回头看向沙发上放出微光的金色十字星，几秒后才把它重新拿在手里。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_fox",
          "r_star"
